{%- comment -%}
  Size box: "Dimensions" and "Angle" of the variant on screen, as on the live product page ("Dimensions (in)" / "Angle").
  It changes with the Size choice (Big / Small).
    render 'grs-dims', mode: 'pdp', product: p, variant: cv   -> product page, under the options
    render 'grs-dims', mode: 'qv'                             -> quick view (needs assets/grs.js to send "grs:qv")
  One line per variant: variant ID | dimensions | angle | note (the note is not shown).
  A product with no lines shows no box. The numbers are the ones the live product page shows (Oct 2026).
{%- endcomment -%}
